# One line-ending policy for every checkout: the pack-line gate compares
# README.md figures against a live `npm pack --dry-run`, and npm packs the
# worktree bytes — a Windows CRLF checkout inflated the tarball by 664 bytes
# (119,320 vs 118,656) and failed docs-sync on windows-latest only. LF in the
# worktree on every OS keeps one number.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
